<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Aug CPI +0.4 vs +0.3 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Israel's Aug CPI +0.4 vs +0.3 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of</p>
<p>Statistics issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>ISRAEL CONSUMER PRICES   Aug 96    July 96   Aug 95</p>
<p>Month-on-month change    + 0.4     + 0.3     + 1.2</p>
<p>Year-on-year change	+12.0     +12.9     + 8.9</p>
<p>Index (base 100=1993)    139.4     138.9     124.5</p>
<p>Note: To compare previous indices based on 1987=100.0, multiply indices from January 1994 by 2.421.</p>
<p>- Jerusalem newsroom, 972-2-370-502</p>
</text>
